      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "A lot of this form is intertwined but it looks a good race for JOHNNIE PINCH (3). Comes off a close-up third over 1650m latest on the synthetic but this course and distance has had seven tries for a win and five minors. Looks a top chance to find form. MERLIN BEACH (2) is racing well with a 2400m win two back then a fourth when back in trip last time at Devonport. Better off this longer journey. NATIVE CLAN (5) has been kept fresh since finishing runner-up to MERLIN BEACH a month ago. Meets the winner better at the weights and can turn the tables. HAPPY CLAN (1) comes through the same race at MERLIN BEACH last time and they finished alongside each other. Definite each-way chance. AL MAXIMUS (4) finished alongside JOHNNIE PINCH last time so hard to be included.",
